{"content": "1|// tiny-stack-vm entry for make.fun tiny-stack-vm-01-run-20261122
2|// Faithful port of the reference VM (kit generator/subject/vm.mjs, ISA v1).
3|// Reads /input/<id>/program.bin + input.bin, writes /output/<id>/stdout.bin + exit.txt.
4|// Env overrides: MAKEFUN_INPUT_DIR, MAKEFUN_OUTPUT_DIR.
